{"id":"c202e401aa180874","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-zfc-measure2-measurable-map.md","title":"ZFC Measure2 Measurable Map","display":"df-zfc-measure2-measurable-map — ZFC Measure2 Measurable Map","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-measure2-measurable-map","aliases":["58-df-zfc-measure2-measurable-map"],"display":"df-zfc-measure2-measurable-map — ZFC Measure2 Measurable Map","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-measure2-measurable-map"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-measure2-measurable-map</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-measure2-measurable-map — ZFC Measure2 Measurable Map"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md\">../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\Sigma,Y,\\mathcal T,f\\in V\">\\(X,\\Sigma,Y,\\mathcal T,f\\in V\\)</span>, with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\">\\(\\Sigma\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T\\subseteq\\mathcal P(Y)\">\\(\\mathcal T\\subseteq\\mathcal P(Y)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure2MeasurableMap}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure2MeasurableMap}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md\">../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure2\\text{-}measurable\\text{-}map}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure2MeasurableMap}_S(f,X,\\Sigma,Y,\\mathcal T)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\Sigma,X)\n\\land\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal T,Y)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall B\\in\\mathcal T\\;(f^{-1}[B]\\in\\Sigma).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure2\\text{-}measurable\\text{-}map}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure2MeasurableMap}_S(f,X,\\Sigma,Y,\\mathcal T)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\Sigma,X)\n\\land\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal T,Y)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall B\\in\\mathcal T\\;(f^{-1}[B]\\in\\Sigma).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"a740bdad87b97ac6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3$ (see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"a740bdad87b97ac6","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}\\subseteq V^2$ (see [[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\Sigma,Y,\\mathcal T,f\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal T\\subseteq\\mathcal P(Y)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure2MeasurableMap}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure2\\text{-}measurable\\text{-}map}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure2MeasurableMap}_S(f,X,\\Sigma,Y,\\mathcal T)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\Sigma,X)\n\\land\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal T,Y)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall B\\in\\mathcal T\\;(f^{-1}[B]\\in\\Sigma).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1205,"backlinks":[{"id":"0cf51aa7714e68eb","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure2MeasurableMap}_S\\subseteq V^5$ (see [[58-df-zfc-measure2-measurable-map.md]])"},{"id":"3ce8a66e6c0444a6","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"04d24c4f69f28d75","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure2MeasurableMap}_S\\subseteq V^5$ (see [[58-df-zfc-measure2-measurable-map.md]])"},{"id":"8902399f82dbe8a2","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure2MeasurableMap}_S\\subseteq V^5$（参数顺序为 $(X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,Y,\\mathcal B)$，其中 $X$ 是映射，see [[../batch01/58-df-zfc-measure2-measurable-map.md]]）"},{"id":"5c8ba0e6355b38cd","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure2MeasurableMap}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch01/58-df-zfc-measure2-measurable-map.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2573","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-measure2-measurable-map.md|58-df-zfc-measure2-measurable-map]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","36d7463d215be751","a740bdad87b97ac6"]}